===Verb===
{{head|en|verb form}}

# {{infl of|en|attach||ed-form}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Connected; joined.
# Fond of (used with ''to'').
#: {{ux|en|I'm very '''attached''' to my pets.}}
# An [[auxiliary]] document included or sent with another (especially an [[email]] or other electronic communication).
#: {{ux|en|Please see the '''attached''' file in my previous email.}}
# In a romantic or sexual relationship.
#: {{ux|en|As far as I know, he isn't '''attached''', so I'm going to invite him out on a date.}}
#: {{ux|en|I'm not ready to get '''attached''', as I want to continue sleeping around.}}
# {{lb|en|botany|mycology}} Broadly joined to a [[stem]] or [[stipe]], but not [[decurrent]].
#: {{ux|en|In this group of mushrooms, the attachment of the gills to the stipe ranges from '''attached''' to almost decurrent.}}
# Of a residential building, sharing walls with similar buildings on two, usually opposite, sides.

